sourcePath":".project/run-bundles/shadow-council-reviewer-output-reliability-v1-smoke/evidence/shadow-seat-attestation-seat-google-7af4db0a4737f850256a76d2196096de7384e12d8034faf6555e63770e147488.json","summary":"Admitted Shadow Council attestation for seat-google."},{"action":"present","contentHash":"sha256:5bbe8b9be833449b4ea95ae30fdf1c3fbc56ed5a6e3a65361ea75c7ed8ca3ff4","evidenceId":"shadow-vote-assessment:sha256:931f05fffbbfa3c57a2633e3f8d4570de2f1db2af6c3efae2112418ec6b88632","kind":"ARTIFACT","path":".project/run-bundles/shadow-council-reviewer-output-reliability-v1-smoke/evidence/shadow-vote-assessment-seat-anthropic-5bbe8b9be833449b4ea95ae30fdf1c3fbc56ed5a6e3a65361ea75c7ed8ca3ff4.json","producedBy":{"role":"REVIEWER","threadId":null,"tool":"shadow-council-harness"},"sourcePath":".project/run-bundles/shadow-council-reviewer-output-reliability-v1-smoke/evidence/shadow-vote-assessment-seat-anthropic-5bbe8b9be833449b4ea95ae30fdf1c3fbc56ed5a6e3a65361ea75c7ed8ca3ff4.json","summary":"Approve: the candidate resolves all five sub-questions inside the advisory boundary, leaves the 1200-character ceiling parser-enforced and untouched, and its (e) reasoning is decisive — a decoder-level token clamp would trade a soft overshoot for mid-sentence truncation and invalid JSON, so prompt budget plus a validation-triggered reprompt is the right escalation. It also declines to overclaim V3/V4 causation. Caveat: the summary calls the 600 budget 'strictly lower' when it is lower than the ceiling, not the 500 target; tighten that wording before it is copied into packet prose."},{"action":"present","contentHash":"sha256:928cb3c4fcc69bb2fe233bd806545432c43ff7422908d3c27bbdbf3d721e9301","evidenceId":"shadow-vote-assessment:sha256:be068b820a82589555d1b402c6319b36105a9bbda2eac4aa40e44121e21c59d3","kind":"ARTIFACT","path":".project/run-bundles/shadow-council-reviewer-output-reliability-v1-smoke/evidence/shadow-vote-assessment-seat-openai-928cb3c4fcc69bb2fe233bd806545432c43ff7422908d3c27bbdbf3d721e9301.json","producedBy":{"role":"REVIEWER","threadId":null,"tool":"shadow-council-harness"},"sourcePath":".project/run-bundles/shadow-council-reviewer-output-reliability-v1-smoke/evidence/shadow-vote-assessment-seat-openai-928cb3c4fcc69bb2fe233bd806545432c43ff7422908d3c27bbdbf3d721e9301.json","summary":"The candidate preserves the immutable acceptance boundary while creating substantial provider-neutral headroom, and appropriately treats the V3/V4 failures as evidence consistent with—not proof of—a ceiling-anchoring cause. Its prompt-first approach also avoids decoder caps that could produce truncated or invalid output; the main residual caveat is that the proposed retry should remain a separately evaluated escalation, since it exceeds the stated prompt-text-only scope."},{"action":"present","contentHash":"sha256:5717fecd1f2b761ddea000470613cfc091d42932880fae670f51e82fa4a69810","evidenceId":"shadow-vote-assessment:sha256:f424eb6aae24eaba98914f028356a3b6c6279d522eaf157daa8fb446779ef363","kind":"ARTIFACT","path":".project/run-bundles/shadow-council-reviewer-output-reliability-v1-smoke/evidence/shadow-vote-assessment-seat-google-5717fecd1f2b761ddea000470613cfc091d42932880fae670f51e82fa4a69810.json","producedBy":{"role":"REVIEWER","threadId":null,"tool":"shadow-council-harness"},"sourcePath":".project/run-bundles/shadow-council-reviewer-output-reliability-v1-smoke/evidence/shadow-vote-assessment-seat-google-5717fecd1f2b761ddea000470613cfc091d42932880fae670f51e82fa4a69810.json","summary":"The proposal effectively mitigates first-call character overflow by establishing a 500/600-character soft generation budget with 2x headroom while keeping the 1200-character acceptance ceiling and provider neutrality intact. The primary residual caveat is ensuring the dual numbers are centrally referenced to prevent template maintenance drift."}],"evidenceManifestHash":"sha256:300f9ef3cdd0b98cd992dfc86e722203a5b0fd6edd79bc9076887340a983a3df"}
